WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:08.790
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:14.010
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.370
This is awful...

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.930
The war has been going on for a very long time.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:24.500
And that's why you stood up to fight back.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.080
God has told me to save France.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:28.710
But...

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.970
Whether the crown prince Charles will believe that or not is the problem.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:37.080
But historically, Jeanne was able to meet with him, wasn't she?

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.300
History is unstable right now.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.350
There's a good chance that she'll be turned away at the gate.

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:44.040
No way...

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.290
It'll be okay, Jeanne.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.500
You have us.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.690
Thank you.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:51.910
There's the castle.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:56.860
Oh Heavenly Father, please give me courage.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:38.470
So this is Castle Chinon.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.930
The castle of His Royal Highness Charles.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:43.710
Now for the meeting that will decide the fate of France.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:44.470
Jeanne.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:50.040
We've come this far, so all there is to do now is push on ahead.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.050
You can do it, Miss Jeanne.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:52.940
Okay.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.210
Jeanne d'Arc is here?

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:00.080
I have kept her waiting in the courtyard for the present time.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.680
Let's send her away.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.790
Hear the voice of God, she says! It's ludicrous!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:10.250
However, there are some soldiers among us who believe that Jeanne truly is a messenger of God.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:14.030
I have a fun idea.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.590
They don't trust me.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.050
Don't let yourself be bothered by that.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:32.520
But reinforcements must be sent to Orléans as quickly as possible...

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:38.080
If you show your worry here, not even the simple things will work out.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.580
Ranmaru.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.010
Jeanne d'Arc will save France.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.530
That's how history is supposed to go.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.120
That's right! Jeanne d'Arc is a hero.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.800
Just do what your mind has set out to do.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.400
Besides, you have God on your side, right?

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.080
You're right.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.050
Jeanne.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:58.980
His Royal Highness has summoned you.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.480
I understand.

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:06.170
That's great news, Jeanne.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.600
The rest of you will wait here.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.560
Let me accompany her as her valet.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.860
Well, if it's only one of you...

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:19.860
Very well.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.250
Thank you.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.810
Miss Jeanne, you can do it!

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:31.870
Are you Jeanne d'Arc?

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:34.770
Well?

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.000
Y-Yes.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:41.190
I've heard that your fighting skills put other chevaliers to shame, but you don't look at all reliable.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.640
You wish to speak with His Royal Highness?

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:46.500
Well...

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:56.760
I-I won't speak unless it is with the Dauphin.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:58.270
The insolence!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.000
You dare to seclude us?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.880
Calm yourself, La Hire.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:11.180
Very well, Jeanne.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.620
You may have your audience with the Dauphin.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.620
T-Thank you!

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.870
I am Charles.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.040
Raise your head.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.110
Show respect to your Dauphin!

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.400
But...

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.010
Tell them what's on your mind.

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.030
This man is not the Dauphin.

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:55.460
What?

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:57.980
Not him...

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:58.790
Not him...

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.540
Where is His Royal Highness?

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.630
Do you think Jeanne will be okay?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.300
They say that His Royal Highness Charles was a very skeptical person.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.470
Skeptical?

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.670
The French royal family had a lot of enemies.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.860
I hope things work out for Jeanne-san.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:22.270
While we're waiting, let's play soccer.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:25.400
If we get discouraged, it'll prevent Jeanne from doing her best.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.000
Tenma is right.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.740
Okay then...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:30.870
Let's go!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.520
You're so sudden.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:34.600
I can barely move!

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.010
This might be good training, in a way!

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:46.400
Why don't we have a game, then?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:47.970
Good idea!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.130
Then those two areas will be the goals.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.780
What about teams?

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:53.460
You decide, Tenma.

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:56.300
Then me, Fei, and Shinsuke in one.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.440
Tsurugi and Kinako and...

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:00.030
We're missing one.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.870
Then we just need to invite one more person.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.630
Let's see...

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.390
Hiya!

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:11.740
Are you from this castle?

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.910
I am a mere, ordinary soldier.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.470
Would you perhaps be interested in soccer?

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.350
Soccer?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.970
Come on, play soccer with us!

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:25.390
It's okay. Even through time, soccer is universal.

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:26.920
You can do it if you try!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:31.920
Since I have the free time, I will do you the favor of joining in.

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:35.100
So you only move the ball with your feet?

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:38.390
Score the ball into the other team's goal, and you win one point.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.500
I see.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.130
So this goal signifies the enemy's castle.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.100
That's right! You're smart!

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.540
But of course!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.610
You're on my team.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.050
You should stay back and watch how everything goes first.

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:53.030
Stay back and watch?

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:54.710
Absurd!

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:58.300
A chevalier must not fall behind in his charge of the castle!

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:00.870
Well, never mind.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.710
I can play any position anyway, so I'm okay with wherever I'm placed.

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.960
We make the first attack.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.180
Kickoff!

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.400
You won't score if you just shoot right off the bat.

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.760
Is that so?

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.140
Soccer is teamwork.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.250
I'll take care of it!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:32.580
Okay!

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.720
So close! It had a good trajectory!

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.160
I see! I'm beginning to understand!

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.760
Okay, here we go!

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:52.090
Give me the ball!

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:53.970
I'm not doing that!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.590
I said, give it to me!

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:58.280
Get back!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:00.830
Fei!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.440
Leave it to me!

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:07.760
Here it comes!

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.050
Don't shoot, it's impossible!

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.910
Nothing is impossible for me!

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.550
It went in!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.440
Voilà!

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.080
That was a show of my true strength.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:23.640
What fun! This soccer is fun!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.170
I finally got it!

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:32.770
The card game...

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.630
You seem quite strong.

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:36.930
Then let's battle!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.180
You've got my attention!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.510
Wondebanandabada!

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.750
Nii-san, give me strength!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.620
So we're evenly matched...

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:50.710
Next time-

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:52.730
You're already starting up again?!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.240
Heat-up-your-chest Starter Deck!

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.860
Raimon Induction Campaign!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:04.090
Orléans may be on the verge of surrender while we're kept waiting here!

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:05.250
Jeanne...

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:08.820
Where is the Dauphin?

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:12.590
I rather like soccer.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.840
That's great.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.680
Are you sure it's okay for us to be wandering around the castle?

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.720
I allow it.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:23.400
This guy seems rather arrogant compared to the other soldiers, don't you think?

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.640
Yeah.

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.330
We can't go there!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:29.480
We'll get yelled at!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.020
Don't worry about it.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:39.180
Jeanne?

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:42.780
Jeanne!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.960
I-It is an honor to meet you,

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.640
Lord Dauphin Charles.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.520
His Royal Highness?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.930
I greet you from your long journey, Jeanne d'Arc.

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:02.930
Yes, sir.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:06.180
She saw through His Royal Highness's disguise.

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:09.680
A double?

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:12.520
Jeanne does not know what I look like.

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:16.430
But if her guidance from God bears truth...

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:18.940
She would be able to identify you.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.020
That's right.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.900
I will win the crown?

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:29.830
Y-You will become the king of France and bring peace to this country.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.330
Is that what God has told you?

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.540
Y-Yes.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:38.780
We lay helpless before the force of England,

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:41.990
and even Reims has fallen into the clutches of the enemy.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:45.110
Tell me, how do you intend to crown me king within this situation?

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:46.950
Well...

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:56.550
I-It's true that many of our territories, beginning with Paris, our capital, are now ruled by England.

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:02.050
B-But because of it, the enemy's forces are decentralized.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:08.330
If we gather together our military forces and fight with courage, we are sure to win.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:13.590
But if Orléans is to fall, I cannot guarantee that.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.210
Please, you must send reinforcements to Orléans at once!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.700
La Hire!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:29.660
Gilles de Rais!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.010
Sir!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:33.050
Call together your troops and head for Orléans!

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.400
As you wish.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:38.360
Dauphin!

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:40.100
Jeanne!

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.780
Your feelings for France have moved me.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:44.950
Thank you!

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.010
You did it, Jeanne.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:47.950
Yes.

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:54.550
We've come this far at last.

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.310
T-There's still much to do.

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.840
I have to keep working harder.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.220
Tenma!

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:12.020
Kirino! You did it!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.940
That is a lot of troops!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.190
They're real knights!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.900
It's Jeanne d'Arc!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.660
Orléans is saved!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.020
We were waiting for you, Jeanne!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.550
They're all so thin.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:36.500
They said the siege has gone on for so long that they've run out of food.

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.290
My good maiden Jeanne. {calling her Maiden instead of Lady because calling her lady was considered a social atrocity back then}

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:40.960
Thank you for bringing reinforcements.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:42.380
Um...

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.200
I'm sorry for being late.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.500
It must have been so hard on you.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.570
Thank you.

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:49.590
Jeanne...

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.670
Everyone!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.070
We must launch an assault with all of our forces, immediately!

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.230
An assault... with all of our forces?

00:13:56.230 --> 00:14:01.080
England's troops will be wavering upon seeing reinforcements arrive at Orléans.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.990
If we are to strike, it must be now!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.780
Assaulting right now is premature.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.380
Agreed.

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:10.600
Resting from our long journey comes first.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.910
B-But we must fight while the morale of Orléans is still high!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.120
Is that what God has told you?

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:18.830
N-No...

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.190
Leave the fighting to us real chevaliers.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.110
Oh dear...

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:28.300
These people won't listen to me.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:42.360
If we don't fight now, we'll lose our chance.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.940
Aren't you scared?

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:52.700
If I run away, the suffering of the French people will not end.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:54.550
Jeanne...

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:55.910
I was chosen.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.390
But am I even capable enough to do this?

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:02.390
You're incredible, Jeanne.

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:07.410
You stood up all by yourself to save your people from suffering,

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:09.880
and your determination moved the heart of the Dauphin.

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:15.350
There is something out there that only you can do.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:19.390
Maybe that's why you were chosen, Jeanne.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.490
Something that only I can do?

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.850
I only hope there's something out there that only I can do, too...

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:29.530
Ranmaru...

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:42.140
I've heard that the chevaliers are a proud lot, but it appears I was wrong.

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:48.500
What?!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:53.300
The enemy is right in front of you, and yet you choose to do nothing about it!

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.760
Could it be that you think you'll lose?

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:57.290
Silence!

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.330
The enemy is exhausted, with very little troops remaining.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.940
If we keep our defense tight and wait it out, they will leave.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.980
What do you plan to do if they bring in their own reinforcements?!

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.490
Well...

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.730
Bad news, sir!

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:13.850
The Maiden has gone out leading her troops to attack England's fortress!

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:15.490
What?!

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.650
Something that only I can do...

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:29.450
The Maiden has left a message, saying that she awaits our support.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:33.320
Is she planning to sacrifice herself in order to inspire the rest of the troops?

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.640
I shouldn't have said all of that.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.360
I have to stop her!

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:39.100
Kirino!

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:45.100
There's fire!

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:50.410
E-Everyone!

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:52.400
Let us protect Orléans!

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:54.530
Look out!

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:03.200
What do I do...

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:04.960
Jeanne!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.750
You're...

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:08.630
Who are you?

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:12.570
I am Zanark Avalonic.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:14.380
A member of the lower middle class without a name.

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:16.820
You <i>have</i>  a name.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:17.970
Why did you come here?

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:22.930
I'm looking for whoever will be my playmate.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.980
Curse that Jeanne and her bullheadedness!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.940
She's charged straight to her death.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.690
What is this nonsense I am hearing?!

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.330
How dare you! Hold your tongue!

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:34.650
Your Royal Highness!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.360
Go and help Jeanne d'Arc!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.260
What?

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:39.200
Is that understood?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:42.200
Upon the honor of the French chevaliers, you must protect Jeanne!

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.490
Get out of my way!

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.620
I have to save Jeanne!

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:54.860
There are only two ways you can get to the shore on the other side.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:58.570
Win against me in soccer, or swim.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.220
Although, if you opt to swim, I'll drown you.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.040
What?

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:06.460
Jeanne!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.560
Show me the will of your fight!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.810
Hold on for standby!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.820
Field Make Mode.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:20.530
What?

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.450
Your Royal Highness!

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:24.790
What is...?

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.830
I'll explain before you ask the question.

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:29.750
You aren't able to get out of here until the match is over.

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:34.750
Come now, if you don't hurry, history will change.

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:36.710
Okay then, Zanark or whatever!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:39.740
The great Coach Clark Wonderbat will face you!

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:42.050
What is a coach?

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:46.760
The person in the highest position who gives orders to the rest.

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.560
In other words, a king!

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:53.640
In that case, the Dauphin Charles will be coach for this match!

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:57.620
Three corn dogs!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:58.740
Coming right up!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.410
So busy, so busy...

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:06.590
Honey, hurry-

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:08.660
Gone again...

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:12.010
Where am I?

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:17.420
Raimon undertakes a challenge with the help of the French!

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:19.840
Their coach is His Royal Highness the Dauphin Charles!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:24.140
Fighting against them is Protocol Omega 3.0 led by Zanark Avalonic!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:30.010
Now, with the famous fight for Orléans in the background, the curtains on their showdown are raised!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:32.740
Those guys...

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:34.150
Something's different.

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:40.320
We will show you the power of Protocol Omega 3.0
 Mixi-maxed with Zanark-sama.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:41.740
What?

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:44.570
They're all Mixi-maxed?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.100
Let's go.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:50.160
The match begins with Gamma's kickoff!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.920
All of you, protect the king's castle!

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:00.420
King's castle? Does he mean the goal?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.700
All of us, protect the goal?

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.080
That's crazy!

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.140
Does he even know how soccer is played?

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.170
Hey!

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:13.190
Bahams!

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.400
That's not happening!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.100
That's right! Not happening!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:22.200
Bahams makes a tricky pass!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.700
Smart.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.530
That pass was made just as predicted.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:29.490
Are you ready?

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:32.870
You won't get through!

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:36.080
That defense is also just as predicted.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.800
He's able to predict all of our moves!

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.310
You're up against me!

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:45.690
Don't forget me!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.310
Swift Wolf Lycaon!

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.310
This will do it.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:09.570
Protocol Omega makes the first point!

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:14.000
I told you so.

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.430
Did you see that? You did, right?

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:20.750
The real power of Protocol Omega 3.0.

00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:27.340
What do I do...

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:31.560
Jeanne...

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:34.650
Kirino! For now, keep your head in the game!

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:17.380
The intensity of our fight and Jeanne's fight increases.

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:21.540
Within the flames, Jeanne's feelings complete the Mixi-max!

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:24.390
Next, A Vow Upon This Flag!

00:23:24.390 --> 00:23:25.920
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:36.990
Hiro-kun, take care of the rest!

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:37.830
Okay!

00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:40.230
Up next is Danball Senki W!
